    <panel_attributes>fontsize=18
*CD06 - LLM layer and prompting (core.llm, core.prompt, app.adapters)*
Patterns: Adapter (Gemini / Ollama behind LlmClient) and Decorator (caching, retry, rate limit). The core never sees a vendor API.</panel_attributes>
